changes.

Zkit maintains a source snapshot of the Apache-2.0 GPUI platform crates.
Initial platform snapshot: https://github.com/zeronsh/zui at 361ff20b919fdfb80199ee6d9aed725300cb7d54.
The component-base crate is adapted from https://github.com/zeronsh/gpui-component at 701ca97af7983bf85343d2d1d404ab528b18ec96.
