See crates/component-base/LICENSE for its Apache-2.0 notice.
Font copyright and licenses are retained under assets/fonts/zkit/licenses.

The styled component layer adapts neutral/accent colors, OKLCH conversions,
motion curves, loader clock/phase calculations and surface primitives from
https://github.com/zeronsh/zeron at 3b2f78027a2c31622c39c35716da4d6e1af8de15.
Copyright (c) 2026 Wing. The MIT license and copyright notice are retained in
crates/components/LICENSE-MIT-SOURCE. Focus traversal also adapts the Apache-2.0
component source snapshot identified above.

The zkit-dither crate (crates/dither) adapts dithering techniques, blue-noise
threshold data, example fields, the globe, its world land mask and loaders
from dithercn (https://github.com/opencoredev/dithercn), Copyright (c) 2026
Leo and Copyright (c) 2026 Shadcn Labs. The MIT license and copyright notice
are retained in crates/dither/LICENSE-MIT. Its charts, dithered buttons and
generative avatars follow the design of dither-kit by ripgrim
(https://tripwire.sh/dither-kit); they are independent implementations and
include no dither-kit source. See crates/dither/NOTICE for details.

The website (website/) uses the zkit-dither engine above, Lucide icons
(https://lucide.dev, ISC license, via the lucide npm package), a Natural Earth
land mask (public domain) and a NASA photograph (public domain; see
website/public/media/CREDITS.md).
